# Testing
coverage/
.nyc_output/
istanbul/
.mocha.opts
.jest/

# Package managers
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# System files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
```